from being freed from the matrix as a  child to saving humanity from extinction  morpheus has quite the life story do you  think you know it all let's review like  the man himself all we're offering is  the truth and nothing more  like many people freed from the virtual  reality prison of the matrix morpheus is  awakened into reality as a child and  spends his adolescence in the last human  city of zion he grows up preparing  himself to do battle against the  machines eventually joining the  resistance and becoming the captain of  his own hovercraft the nebuchadnezzar  within the matrix morpheus becomes a  formidable warrior and hacker infamous  even among humans who are still plugged  in and unaware that their world is an  illusion he is considered by  many authorities to be the most  dangerous man alive  eventually he visits the oracle an  allegedly prescient spiritual leader  according to her prophecy his destiny is  to find the one a person born in the  matrix who has the ability to manipulate  its simulated reality at will and is  destined to lead the humans to freedom  upon learning this morpheus surrounds  himself with a crew who are all equally  devoted to his cause and sets out to  fulfill his destiny  in the matrix morpheus finally tracks  down the person he believes to be the  one a hacker called neo who is obsessed  with the strange feeling that his world  is not what it seems morpheus sends  trinity one of his most loyal crew  members to monitor neo and eventually  makes contact when they finally meet  face to face morpheus offers neo a  choice represented by two pills if neil  takes the blue pill he'll return to his  own life and never hear from morpheus  again if neo takes the red pill morpheus  will show him the truth about the world  but there will be no going back luckily  neo takes the red pill and morpheus and  his crew are able to disconnect him from  the matrix awakening him to the harsh  reality of the real world morpheus soon  introduces neo to the prophecy of the  one and begins training neil to fulfill  his destiny neo has a hard time  believing that he's somehow the savior  of humanity but morpheus faith is  unshakable i don't believe it  it's not possible  i didn't say it would be easy neo  i just said it would be the truth he  attempts to shake neo of his  preconceptions about what is possible  showing him that within the simulation  of the matrix one can exert their will  to bend or break the laws of physics to  become an unstoppable warrior neo needs  only to believe in himself as much as  morpheus believes in him and he can be  strong enough to defeat the machines  during a mission in the matrix the crew  of the nebuchadnezzar is betrayed to the  machines and cornered by their agent  enforcers to ensure that his crew can  get neo to safety morpheus throws  himself at the agents since no human has  ever survived a fight with an agent  morpheus does this with every  expectation that this sacrifice will  mean his death the great morpheus  we meet upon us  and you are  a smith  agent smith  instead he's captured and brought to a  government stronghold for interrogation  as a captain in the resistance fleet  morpheus possesses the security codes  for zion's defense mainframe the  machines know they'll never be able to  coerce this information out of morpheus  by conventional means so they inject his  avatar in the matrix with a computer  virus intended to break his will  morpheus fights their influence for  hours expecting that his crew will make  the practical choice to unplug his body  from the matrix killing him before the  virus can force him to talk neo and  trinity however are unwilling to  sacrifice morpheus and hack back into  the matrix to save him their daring  rescue attempt is a success and with  their help he's able to regain his  strength of will and rid his mind of the  agent's influence neo also finds his  faith in himself during the mission and  accepts his destiny as the one  validating morpheus faith in him  the matrix reloaded picks up six months  after morpheus rescue and neos ascension  to digital demigod as neo's power in the  matrix grows so does morpheus's  reputation among the people of zion more  and more of them put their faith in the  idea that neo will defeat the machines  and end the war this is a source of  frustration for jason locke commander of  zion's defense forces who is not a  believer and wants zion to focus their  efforts on bolstering the city's  defenses as if that wasn't enough locke  is also niobe's live-in partner and is  clearly jealous of her former  relationship with morpheus  what is it between them morpheus and log  niobee captain ivy  she used to be with morpheus  now she's with locke  this conflict comes to a head when it's  discovered that a massive army of  machine sentinels is drilling towards  zion from the surface zion will need to  rally every ship and every soldier to  have even a chance of repelling the  invasion but morpheus convinces zion's  ruling council to allow him and a few  other ships to leave the city and  broadcast into the matrix so that neo  can continue his prophesied path to  victory if locke were thinking  objectively he'd realize that even the  full strength of zion's military doesn't  stand a chance against the machines and  that morpheus gamble far-fetched as it  is might be their only chance locke  however is too stubborn and too wounded  by the subversion of his authority to  see it that way he fights morpheus at  every turn but morpheus wins not only  the faith of the council but also the  vocal support of the people of zion  neo meets with the oracle and returns  with a mission that he's been told will  bring the path of the one to an end  what happens if i fail  then zion  will fall  neo and company will need to break a  program called the key maker from a  well-guarded dungeon sneak him and neo  into a particular building and disable  the power grid of mega city to disable  its explosive security countermeasures  this mission will require the  cooperation of three separate hovercraft  crews and morpheus convinces captain  niobe of the logos and captain soren of  the vigilant to lend their support  together they successfully shepherd neo  and the key maker to their destination  fighting off both agents and the key  makers wardens along the way neo's  mission however turns out to be another  trick put in place by the machines the  oracle's prophecy is actually a  complicated ruse through which the  machines have been manipulating the  resistance the war continues with no  clear path forward even hearing about  this twist straight from neo's mouth  morpheus faith still can't be fully  broken the one was never meant to end  anything  it was all another system of control  i don't believe that  he soon bears another blow to his  resolve when his beloved hovercraft  nebuchadnezzar is destroyed by sentinels  the crew survives but the future of the  resistance is left uncertain as the  machine army grows ever closer to zion  the matrix revolutions picks up  immediately after the destruction of the  nebuchadnezzar as morpheus and his crew  are picked up by another resistance  hovercraft the hammer they're joined  shortly thereafter by the logos  commanded by morpheus's ex captain naobi  the three crews decide that their best  course of action is to return to zion to  help them defend against the machine  invasion meanwhile neo has learned that  he still has a chance of ending the war  if he can make his way to the machine's  capital city in person i can only hope  you know what you're doing  me too  niobi volunteers to pilot the hammer  through a dangerous shortcut back home  to zion and offer neo and trinity the  use of the logos for their trip to the  machine city niobe may never have  believed in the prophecy of the one but  she does believe in neo morpheus acts as  niobe's copilot for the rest of the  mission as she navigates the hammer  through a narrow passageway to zion the  experience draws them closer together  and is strongly implied that they'll be  resuming their relationship after the  end of the war you're a hell of a pilot  some things in this world never change  when the hammer reaches zion its emp  weapon buys the resistance a few  precious hours before the machines can  regroup and resume their invasion during  his debriefing with the council morpheus  reasserts his faith in neo even though  he's not sure exactly how he will be  able to save them but i do know that  as long as there is a single breath in  his body  he will not give up  the sentinels once again breach the city  but suddenly halt their advance the rest  of zion's forces are puzzled but  morpheus knows that this is neo's doing  hundreds of miles away neo has  negotiated a cease-fire with the  machines a former agent called smith has  transformed into a nigh unstoppable  computer virus that threatens to consume  not only the matrix but the entire  machine civilization only neo stands a  chance against him in battle so neo  offers to plug back into the matrix and  confront him in exchange for an end to  the war neo succeeds at the cost of his  own life and the sentinels retreat from  zion morpheus is the first to understand  what's happened his faith and a lifetime  of struggle rewarded morpheus embraces  naobi and sheds tears of joy and relief  morpheus is the only main character from  the original matrix film to survive the  entire trilogy and his story has been  continued both in the series original  continuation the matrix online and in  the much later film sequel the matrix  resurrections the matrix online was a  massive multiplayer rpg that operated  between 2005 and 2009 and dealt with the  machine wars aftermath one of the game's  early story lines reveals that the  machines have not returned neo's body to  zion morpheus is enraged by this and  sets out on a deadly campaign to  destabilize the matrix until his  friend's 